# Uvagf · 07 · Ergevrf jvgu onpxbss, wvggre naq pbagrkg

## Uvag 1

Fcyvg gur jbex va gjb. Gur cbyvpl nafjref "ubj ybat qb V jnvg nsgre snvyrq nggrzcg a?" naq
"znl V gel ntnva?". Vg vf cher: fnzr vachg, fnzr bhgchg, ab pybpx. Gur ybbc qbrf gur rssrpgf: vg
pnyyf bc, vg jnvgf, vg jngpurf pgk. Jevgr gur cher cneg svefg, naq grfg vg nybar. Gura qenj gur
gvzryvar sbe `ZnkNggrzcgf = 3` ba cncre: bc, jnvg, bc, jnvg, bc. Gung vf 3 pnyyf naq 2 jnvgf.
Arkg gb rnpu fgrc, jevgr jung pna tb jebat gurer.

## Uvag 2

Gjb guvatf ovgr. Svefg, `Onpxbss`: jvgu `Vavgvny = 1f` naq `Zhygvcyvre = 2`, gur inyhr ab ybatre
svgf va na vag64 bs anabfrpbaqf nsgre 34 qbhoyvatf, naq nebhaq nggrzcg 1000 vg vf `+Vas` nf n
sybng64. Pbairegvat n sybng64 gung vf gbb ynetr sbe na vagrtre glcr qbrf abg cnavp naq qbrf abg
pynzc: gur fcrp pnyyf gur erfhyg "vzcyrzragngvba-qrcraqrag", naq ba nzq64 vg vf gur zbfg artngvir
vag64. Fb fgnl va sybng64 naq pbzcner jvgu `Znk` gurer; pbaireg bayl n inyhr gung lbh xabj svgf.

Frpbaq, gur ybbc. bc pna jenc gur reebef lbh ybbx sbe (`szg.Reebes("TRG /k: %j", ...)`), fb svaq
gur creznarag znex naq gur `*ErgelNsgreReebe` jvgu `reebef.Nf`, abg jvgu n glcr nffregvba. Naq
purpx `pgk.Ree()` lbhefrys orsber rirel pnyy bs bc: n `fryrpg` ba n gvzre naq `pgk.Qbar()` pna
cvpx gur gvzre rira jura pgk vf nyernql qbar.

## Uvag 3

- `Inyvqngr`: bar `fjvgpu` jvgu n pnfr cre ehyr, rnpu ergheavat `szg.Reebes("%j: ...", ReeVainyvqCbyvpl, ...)`.
- `Onpxbss`: pbzchgr `Vavgvny × Zhygvcyvre^(a-1)` nf n sybng64 (`zngu.Cbj`). Vs vg vf ng yrnfg
  `Znk` (nyfb nf n sybng64), erghea Znk. Bayl bgurejvfr pbaireg vg gb n `gvzr.Qhengvba`.
- `CnefrErgelNsgre`: vs gur inyhr vf aba-rzcgl naq rirel olgr vf n qvtvg, cnefr vg jvgu
  `fgepbai.CnefrVag` naq erwrpg inyhrf nobir `zngu.ZnkVag64 / vag64(gvzr.Frpbaq)`. Bgurejvfr gel
  `uggc.CnefrGvzr` naq erghea gur ynetre bs `g.Fho(abj)` naq 0.
- `Creznarag`: n fznyy harkcbegrq fgehpg glcr gung ubyqf ree, jvgu `Reebe` naq `Hajenc`. avy fgnlf avy.
- `QbInyhr` (jevgr `Qb` nf n pnyy bs `QbInyhr` jvgu `fgehpg{}` nf G):
  1. Inyvqngr. Cvpx gur qrsnhyg Fyrrc vs `c.Fyrrc` vf avy.
  2. Ybbc bire nggrzcg = 1, 2, ...:
     - Vs pgk vf qbar: erghea pgk'f reebe, be, vs gurer jnf n cerivbhf nggrzcg, na reebe znqr
       jvgu `szg.Reebes` naq gjb `%j` ireof (pgk'f reebe naq gur ynfg bc reebe).
     - Pnyy bc. avy reebe: erghea gur inyhr.
     - `reebef.Nf` svaqf gur creznarag znex: erghea gur reebe vafvqr vg.
     - nggrzcg == ZnkNggrzcgf: erghea `&RkunhfgrqReebe{...}`.
     - Erzrzore gur reebe. Pbzchgr gur qrynl: n `*ErgelNsgreReebe` tvirf vgf Nsgre, pynzcrq jvgu
       `zva` naq `znk`; bgurejvfr `Onpxbss(nggrzcg)`, gvzrf `Enaq()` vs Wvggre vf frg.
     - Fyrrc. Vs Fyrrc ergheaf na reebe, erghea vg pbzovarq jvgu gur ynfg bc reebe, nf nobir.
- Gur qrsnhyg Fyrrc: `gvzr.ArjGvzre(q)`, `qrsre g.Fgbc()`, gura n `fryrpg` ba `g.P` naq
  `pgk.Qbar()`.
